<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Genre (Optional):</strong> Horror.</p>
<p><strong>Page Layout (Optional):</strong> I plan to explain about the SCP through Addendums incidents logs and autopsy's this will reveal to to the reader what the SCP can do, the affects of it's powers, and it's origin.</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> The SCP is a spirit that haunts a abandoned factory. It takes form of diffrent toys that the factory used to make but only the toys. The SCP has pshycic that affect anyone in a 500 meter distance. It kills humans with what looks like a tongue and leaves a brown goo after doing so. In the article researchers are trying to find it's origins and more of it's abilities.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> The SCP is found in an abandoned factory in a city in israel. it was due to be destroyed but before being destroyed construction workers were told to inspect the area before demolition. once they entered and saw the spirit SCP one of them decided to take a look. The SCP slashed one of the workers the other one managed to escape. After that incident the foundation was alerted and bought the factory. It set up a site to contain the spirit SCP which could not be moved from the factory. an interview was conducted with the surviving worker after the interview he was given amnestics. an autopsy was conducted and a brown goo-ish material was left behind test results show it is unknown to the foundation yet but it melts all organs. But not bones. In the article the previous incident and test incidents will be inside the article explaining further about the SCP</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> The attention-grabber here is the spirit SCP. Due to it's unique abilities readers would get interested and read more. For example: The spirit SCP has pshycic powers in a 500 meter radius. In the article affects of long exposure to these pshycic powers will be explained through incidents and addendums. It's ability to slash humans in half perfectly will also be tested in the article, as well as the goo it leaves behind. It's mystery and discovery will encourage readers to continue to read.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> If my idea gets accepted i will add more to the SCP. It's origins, and solving most of the mysteries still around it. And again this is just an idea not a full SCP. Thanks for reading</p>

